.claude/worktrees/
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# ─── Security audit report (lists unfixed vulns; repo goes public for CI) ────
SECURITY_AUDIT.md

# ─── QA / audit manifests (ephemeral, contain production IDs) ───────────────
apps/api/scripts/*-manifest-*.json

# ─── Personal working files (live-tenant repair reports — never commit) ──────
.personal/

# ─── Audit reports (list unfixed security findings; repo goes public for CI) ─
docs/audit/

# ─── Generated fuzz fixtures (reproduce via docs/qa/workers/w6-fuzz-pack/generate.js;
